@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
title AFTER MVP — Proposed LC-05 connection intent and calendar identities
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classBackgroundColor #164E63
top to bottom direction
class ProviderConnection {
 +connectionId : ConnectionId
 +ownerAndAccount : VerifiedIdentity
 +capability : ActualCapability
}
class ComposeDraft
class ReviewedSendIntent <<stable snapshot>>
class SendAttempt {
 +attemptId : AttemptId
 +outcome : ObservedOutcome
}
class LocalActivity
class ProviderEventMapping {
 +providerEventIdentity : ScopedEventId
 +changeEvidence : ObservedVersion
}
ProviderConnection -- ComposeDraft : scoped sender context
ComposeDraft ..> ReviewedSendIntent : explicit final review
ReviewedSendIntent -- SendAttempt : attributable dispatch
ProviderConnection -- ProviderEventMapping : current account/capability
LocalActivity -- ProviderEventMapping : explicit association only
note bottom of SendAttempt
 Provider acceptance is not delivery/read.
 Unknown effects require same-attempt reconciliation.
end note
note bottom of ProviderEventMapping
 Local unlink does not delete provider event.
 Physical schema and cardinalities remain to refine.
end note
@enduml
